# `results/logs/` — Generated terminal logs

Use this directory for declared, human-inspectable execution logs and diagnostic
text that belongs to the current generated run. Files are ignored and
regenerated. Snakemake cache/lock/work internals remain in `.snakemake/`, and
durable run identity belongs in `metadata/` after human-approved registration.

See the root [`README.md`](../../README.md) contract and
[`../AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md).
